# Scoped to the data and model trees on purpose. These were bare patterns
# (*.png, *.tif, *.tiff, *.pth), and a bare pattern matches at EVERY depth --
# which silently suppressed docs/source/_static/sample_plate.png, the image
# cd.yml POSTs to /infer as its deploy smoke test, and both images embedded in
# the quickstart tutorial. Keep these anchored so committing a legitimate
# image under docs/ or apps/ does not require `git add -f`.
data/**/*.png
data/**/*.tif
data/**/*.tiff
models/**/*.pth
checkpoints/**/*.pth
*.pth

PLAN.md
auth_migration/

# Airflow runtime artifacts
infra/airflow/logs/
infra/airflow/plugins/
*.log

# Debug artifacts / accidental temp job dumps
response.json
tmp_*/


# Build artifacts of packages/cv-pipeline. Regenerate with:
#   uv build --package cv-pipeline --out-dir dist
# then copy into infra/cloud/{endpoint,train_environment,training_jobs}/
*.whl